[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8220.389, "timestamp": "02:17:00", "text": "无特权者。哦，我肯定那不会发生。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8223.83, "timestamp": "02:17:03", "text": "将会发生。我不这么认为。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8236.309, "timestamp": "02:17:16", "text": "不是。但它确实很漂亮，我就想，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8239.87, "timestamp": "02:17:19", "text": "是的，我不介意为此努力工作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8243.75, "timestamp": "02:17:23", "text": "无论需要多长时间，都要进行建模。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8251.429, "timestamp": "02:17:31", "text": "对你有好处。我真心希望你是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8254.309, "timestamp": "02:17:34", "text": "前辈，你一定能实现你的目标。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8258.07, "timestamp": "02:17:38", "text": "我时不时会偷偷看他一眼。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8261.429, "timestamp": "02:17:41", "text": "桌面或类似指向模型"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8264.83, "timestamp": "02:17:44", "text": "大概持续一两个小时，然后就像这样："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8267.91, "timestamp": "02:17:47", "text": "“是啊，总有一天你会属于我。我要走了。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8272.87, "timestamp": "02:17:52", "text": "“我想把你完全占为己有。”等着瞧吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8274.549, "timestamp": "02:17:54", "text": "是的，这也是原因之一。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8277.429, "timestamp": "02:17:57", "text": "我参加 Jockathon 的原因。你不仅仅是为了"}]